OL,3,GNEWSAFault on key electricity link
OL,4,Aahead of winter peak
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's electricity link
OL,7,Fwith Great Britain has developed a
OL,8,Ffault, halving its capacity to import
OL,9,Fpower ahead of peak winter demand.
OL,11,FMutual Energy, which operates the
OL,12,Fundersea Moyle Interconnector, said the
OL,13,Fcause is still being investigated, and
OL,14,Fit is not yet clear when it will be
OL,15,Frepaired.
OL,17,FHowever, grid operator System Operator
OL,18,FNI (SONI) said that even with the
OL,19,Ffault, it expects sufficient power
OL,20,Fgeneration to meet demand this winter.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
