OL,3,GNEWSAFault on key electricity link
OL,4,Aahead of winter peak
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublishing details in its annual winter
OL,7,Foutlook, SONI's base-case scenario
OL,8,Fassumes the interconnector will return
OL,9,Fto service and that Northern Ireland's
OL,10,Fgas-fired power stations will not be
OL,11,Fconstrained from operating for
OL,12,Fenvironmental reasons.
